  "_meta": {
    "description": "Maps a VirtoCommerce bundle module Id (and the Platform/Theme pseudo-modules) to its GitHub repository under github.com/VirtoCommerce. Used by scripts/bundle-version-check.ts to probe same-line hotfix releases.",
    "owner": "VirtoCommerce",
    "convention": "vc-module-{kebab(Id without 'VirtoCommerce.' prefix)} — used only as a fallback when an Id is absent from `modules` below; the script emits a warning so the missing mapping can be added here.",
    "verifiedAgainst": "vc-modules/modules_v3.json (full module catalog) + bundles/v16 + latest; every repo name resolved to its canonical GitHub name 2026-10-15. Not mapped: VirtoCommerce.ScalableIndexation (lives in the VirtoEnterprise org, outside owner) and VirtoCommerce.OneShell (no repo found).",
    "note": "Many repo names are irregular (singular forms, dropped 'Module' suffix, collapsed casing, X-api split), so the explicit map is the source of truth — do NOT rely on the convention for these.",
    "themeNextRepo": "vc-frontend-next is the next-generation B2B SPA theme (not stable yet, default branch dev). No bundle pins it yet — every bundle still references vc-frontend via ThemeB2BVue — and no script reads themeNextRepo today."
  },
